{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Re-learn how to use your hands from scratch in </strong><strong><i>Chef Hands : Kitch</i></strong><strong>en Mayhem !</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you control a hand with simple to understand yet hard to master controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clients order food and your goal is to ensure they receive good quality dishes in a timely manner and with the utmost hygiene (Or not\u2026).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, it isn\u2019t as easy as it sounds. preparing food with clumsy hands is a real challenge !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Some of your duties as a Chef hand</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble on a plate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook burgers and steaks in a <strong>restaurant</strong>;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook eggs, bacon, pancakes and make sandwiches in a <strong>moving Food-Truck</strong>;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook with low gravity in <strong>space</strong>;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And for those who want extra difficulty, in a <strong>speeding Food-Truck</strong> on a bumpy road where ingredients are thrown all around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can control your hand using your mouse and keyboard or with a controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Too much for one chef ? Split tasks between a maximum of 4 chefs in local multiplayer. All you need is one controller per player and to press join (One of them can use the mouse &amp; keyboard).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima