semble on a plate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook burgers and steaks in a <strong>restaurant</strong>;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook eggs, bacon, pancakes and make sandwiches in a <strong>moving Food-Truck</strong>;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook with low gravity in <strong>space</strong>;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And for those who want extra difficulty, in a <strong>speeding Food-Truck</strong> on a bumpy road where ingredients are thrown all around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can control your hand using your mouse and keyboard or with a controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Too much for one chef ? Split tasks between a maximum of 4 chefs in local multiplayer. All you need is one controller per player and to press join (One of them can use the mouse &amp; keyboard).</p>","developers":["Miam Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179160/5d09b2ffc5f68c667d84dd42e5a78769f84bb9fd/header.jpg?t=1746300003","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257047494,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257047494/movie480.mp4?t=1746299710","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257047494/movie_max.mp4?t=1746299710"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257047494/ab844f92e52ba5af2b67e12366c2f92a4fe2da1f/movie_600x337.